<title>FINLAND: Kone falls to FIM 19 mln Jan-April loss.</title>
<headline>Kone falls to FIM 19 mln Jan-April loss.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinary items, tax	  19 vs 17 profit</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 5.20 vs 0.87 profit</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,392 vs 2,972</p>
<p> Operating loss					19 vs 18 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 12 analysts' forecast for Finnish elevator maker Kone Oy's profit before extras and tax had been 29 million markka in a 12-48 million markka range.</p>
</text>
